<?jelly escape-by-default='true'?>
<div>
  Adds initiator metadata, an "only my builds" filter, extended search and a reuse-parameters
  shortcut to the native Jenkins build history sidebar. Filtering and paging happen on the server,
  so a match older than the first page is still found, and rows are rendered by Jenkins' own
  history views so status icons, badges, progress bars and the dark theme are unchanged.
</div>
